{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:59:37.189682", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Assessment:\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with a central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1 to switch_8). Hosts are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The management/control network (20.0.0.0/24) is used for OpenFlow communication with the SDN controller at 20.0.0.100.\\n\\n#### Observations:\\n1. **Reachability Results**:\\n   - **Host-to-Host Communication**:\\n     - Host_1 is unable to communicate with Host_5. The status is marked as \"unknown,\" and no packets are transmitted or received.\\n     - Host_2 successfully communicates with Host_5, with no packet loss and an average RTT of 27.172 ms.\\n     - Host_3 successfully communicates with Host_5, with no packet loss and an average RTT of 29.051 ms.\\n     - Host_4 successfully communicates with Host_5, with no packet loss and an average RTT of 27.985 ms.\\n     - Host_5 is unable to communicate with Host_1. The status is marked as \"unknown,\" and no packets are transmitted or received.\\n     - Host_6 successfully communicates with Host_5, with no packet loss and an average RTT of 27.363 ms.\\n     - Host_7 successfully communicates with Host_5, with no packet loss and an average RTT of 28.152 ms.\\n     - Host_8 successfully communicates with Host_5, with no packet loss and an average RTT of 27.801 ms.\\n\\n   - **Anomalies**:\\n     - Host_1 and Host_5 exhibit communication issues. Both hosts are unable to transmit or receive packets to/from each other, and their statuses are marked as \"unknown.\"\\n     - Other hosts (Host_2, Host_3, Host_4, Host_6, Host_7, Host_8) successfully communicate with Host_5, indicating that the issue is localized to Host_1 and Host_5.\\n\\n2. **Performance Metrics**:\\n   - For successful communications, RTT values are within acceptable ranges (approximately 27-29 ms on average), with no packet loss observed.\\n\\n#### Diagnosis:\\nThe network exhibits localized communication issues between Host_1 and Host_5. While other hosts can successfully communicate with Host_5, Host_1 is unable to establish connectivity. This suggests potential issues with:\\n   - Host_1\\'s network configuration or connectivity.\\n   - Host_5\\'s network configuration or connectivity.\\n   - The edge switches (switch_1 and switch_5) connected to Host_1 and Host_5, respectively.\\n   - The central switch (switch_0) or its links to switch_1 and switch_5.\\n\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of the anomaly., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='398f2f96-f952-442b-be87-fddfa096fbb9'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
